  "question": {
    "text": "The electronic configuration of few elements is given below. Mark the statement which is not correct about these elements.<br/><br/>(i)  <math><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>(ii)  <math><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>(iii)  <math><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>(iv)  <math><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
  },
